hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"248","On the authority of Bundar, on the authority of Muhammad ibn Jaafar, on the authority of Shu’bah, on the authority of Ibrahim ibn Muhajir, who said: I heard Safiyya speaking, on the authority of Aisha, that Asmaa: I asked the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, about washing after menstruation, and he mentioned some hadith, and I asked him about washing from impurity. He said: “One of you takes her water and purifies herself, and purifies herself well, then pours the water on her head and rubs it until it reaches the roots.” her head, then she poured water over her head.” Aisha said: “What good women are the women of the Ansar. Their modesty did not prevent them from agreeing on religion.”"
